WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.299 line:8%
Open the pending receipt and check its evidence and student details.

00:00:05.303 --> 00:00:10.088 line:8%
Choose Reject only when it cannot be accepted, and give a clear reason.

00:00:10.088 --> 00:00:13.401 line:8%
Use Skip instead if you need to decide later.

00:00:14.409 --> 00:00:16.681 line:8%
Confirm and check the status.

00:00:16.681 --> 00:00:22.132 line:8%
Skipping keeps the receipt pending; Show skipped again brings those cards back.
